LinNo/Source statements: 
00001 /*---------------------------------------------------------------+                                                 
00002 | Function : Standard profile exec which uses 3 levels of input  |                                                 
00003 |                                                                |                                                 
00004 | File     : STDPROF  EXEC                                       |                                                 
00005 +----------------------------------------------------------------+                                                 
00006 | Version  : 1.1.0                                               |                                                 
00007 |                                                                |                                                 
00008 | Files    : STDPROF  SYSTEM   input, generic profile            |                                                 
00009 |          : STDPROF  <node>   input, node specific profile      |                                                 
00010 |          : STDPROF  <userid> input, user specific profile      |                                                 
00011 |                                                                |                                                 
00012 | Called   : STDPROF  <startparm>                                |                                                 
00013 |                                                                |                                                 
00014 | Comments : Obtaining variables in the underlying execs, for    |                                                 
00015 |            example in pre_exit and post_exit:                  |                                                 
00016 |                PIPE var <varname> 1 | ....                     |                                                 
00017 |                PIPE rexxvars 1 toload | varload                |                                                 
00018 |                                                                |                                                 
00019 | Author   : H.T.Kramer, ,                                       |                                                 
00020 | Created  : 20180128 16:00:04                                   |                                                 
00021 | Changes  : .                                                   |                                                 
00022 |                                                                |                                                 
00023 +---------------------------------------------------------------*/                                                 
00024 Parse Upper Arg startparm                                                                                          
00025 Parse Source . . myfn myft .                                                                                       
00026 /*---------------------------------------------------------------+                                                 
00027 | .                                                              |                                                 
00028 +---------------------------------------------------------------*/                                                 
00029 Parse Value myfn With . fb .                                                                                       
00030 Call Init                                                                                      [SUB7]
00031 'PIPE (NAME STDPROF.EXEC:26 END ?)',                                                                               
00032    'cp QUERY USERID',                                                                                              
00033    '| specs w3.1 1',                                                                                               
00034    '| var node',                                                                                                   
00035    '?',                                                                                                            
00036    'cp QUERY USER 'Userid(),                                                                                       
00037    '| specs fs - f2.1 1',                                                                                          
00038    '| pick w1.1 == ~DSC~',                                                                                         
00039    '| count lines',                                                                                                
00040    '| var disc'                                                                                                    
00041 /*---------------------------------------------------------------+                                                 
00042 | Check if the files needed exist                                |                                                 
00043 +---------------------------------------------------------------*/                                                 
00044 systinp=Checkfile(myfn' SYSTEM')                                                                                   
00045 nodeinp=CheckFile(myfn node)                                                                   [SUB5]
00046 userinp=CheckFile(myfn Userid())                                                               [SUB5]
00047 /*---------------------------------------------------------------+                                                 
00048 | If the files exist load them                                   |                                                 
00049 +---------------------------------------------------------------*/                                                 
00050 If systinp Then Call LoadFile(myfn' SYSTEM')                                                   [SUB6]
00051 If nodeinp Then Call LoadFile(myfn node)                                                       [SUB6]
00052 If userinp Then Call LoadFile(myfn Userid())                                                   [SUB6]
00053 /*---------------------------------------------------------------+                                                 
00054 | Here we start running the various items found                  |                                                 
00055 +---------------------------------------------------------------*/                                                 
00056 If pre_exit<>''     Then Do                                                                          (DO1-Start)
00057                          Say TimeStamp() 'Running pre-exit: 'pre_exit                          [SUB8]
00058                          Address CMS pre_exit                                                                      
00059                          End                                                                         (DO1-End)
00060 If access_items<>'' Then Call Do_Access                                                        [SUB2]
00061 If tooling<>''      Then Call Do_Tooling                                                       [SUB3]
00062 If cpcmds<>''       Then Call Do_Cmds 'CP'                                                     [SUB4]
00063 If cmscmds<>''      Then Call Do_Cmds 'CMS'                                                    [SUB4]
00064 If run<>''          Then Address CMS run                                                                           
00065 If post_exit<>''    Then Do                                                                          (DO2-Start)
00066                          Say TimeStamp() 'Running post-exit: 'post_exit                        [SUB8]
00067                          Address CMS post_exit                                                                     
00068                          End                                                                         (DO2-End)
00069 If disc &,                                                                                                         
00070    servercode<>''   Then Address serverenv servercode                                                              
00071                     Else If servercode<>'' Then Say TimeStamp()' To start servercode 'serverco [SUB8]
00072                                                                                                                    
00073 Exit:                                                                                          [SUB1-Start]
00074 /*---------------------------------------------------------------+                                                 
00075 | General Exit routine                                           |                                                 
00076 +---------------------------------------------------------------*/                                                 
00077 Parse Arg exrc errmsg                                                                                              
00078 If Datatype(exrc,'NUM') Then Say errmsg exrc                                                                       
00079                         Else exrc=0                                                                                
00080 Exit exrc                                                                                      [SUB1]
00081                                                                                                                    
00082                                                                                                                    
00083 Do_Access:                                                                                     [SUB2-Start]
00084 /*---------------------------------------------------------------+                                                 
00085 | Access filepools or minidisks                                  |                                                 
00086 +---------------------------------------------------------------*/                                                 
00087 'PIPE (NAME STDPROF.EXEC:73 END ?)',                                                                               
00088   'var access_items',                            /* Take this        */                                            
00089   '| split at ;',                                /* Split here       */                                            
00090   '| strip',                                     /* Remove spaces    */                                            
00091   '| stem access.',                              /* Hand 2 rexx      */                                            
00092   '?',                                           /* 2nd pipe         */                                            
00093   'var ifrc0',                                   /* Take this        */                                            
00094   '| split at ;',                                /* Split here       */                                            
00095   '| strip',                                     /* Remove spaces    */                                            
00096   '| stem ifrc.'                                 /* Hand 2 rexx      */                                            
00097 Do a=1 To access.0                                                                                   (DO3-Start)
00098    Address CMS access.a                                                                                            
00099    If rc=0 &,                                                                                                      
00100       ifrc.a<>'' Then Do                                                                             (DO4-Start)
00101                       Address CMS ifrc.a                                                                           
00102                       End                                                                            (DO4-End)
00103                  Else If rc<>0 Then Say TimeStamp() 'Non-zero rc on: 'access.a                 [SUB8]
00104 End a                                                                                                (DO3-End)
00105                                                                                                                    
00106 Select                                                                                           {SEL1-Start}
00107 When a Then Do                                                                                       (DO5-Start)
00108             b                                                                                                      
00109             End                                                                                      (DO5-End)
00110 When c Then Do                                                                                       (DO6-Start)
00111             d                                                                                                      
00112             e                                                                                                      
00113             End                                                                                      (DO6-End)
00114 Otherwise Do                                                                                         (DO7-Start)
00115            f                                                                                                       
00116            g                                                                                                       
00117           End                                                                                        (DO7-End)
00118 End                                                                                              {SEL1-End}
00119 Return                                                                                         [SUB2-End]
00120                                                                                                                    
00121                                                                                                                    
00122 Do_Tooling:                                                                                    [SUB3-Start]
00123 Select                                                                                           {SEL2-Start}
00124 When a Then Do                                                                                       (DO8-Start)
00125             b                                                                                                      
00126             End                                                                                      (DO8-End)
00127 When c Then Do                                                                                       (DO9-Start)
00128             d                                                                                                      
00129             e                                                                                                      
00130             End                                                                                      (DO9-End)
00131 End                                                                                              {SEL2-End}
00132 /*---------------------------------------------------------------+                                                 
00133 | Access the tooling you need                                    |                                                 
00134 +---------------------------------------------------------------*/                                                 
00135 Address CMS tooling                                                                                                
00136 If rc<>0 &,                                                                                                        
00137    alt_tooling<>'' Then Do                                                                           (DO10-Start)
00138                         Say TimeStamp()' Accessing alternate tooling'                          [SUB8]
00139                         Address CMS alt_tooling                                                                    
00140                         End                                                                          (DO10-End)
00141 Return                                                                                         [SUB3-End]
00142                                                                                                                    
00143                                                                                                                    
00144 Do_Cmds:                                                                                       [SUB4-Start]
00145 /*---------------------------------------------------------------+                                                 
00146 | Issue the CP and CMS commands when offered                     |                                                 
00147 +---------------------------------------------------------------*/                                                 
00148 Parse Upper Arg switch .                                                                                           
00149 If switch='CP'  Then Do                                                                              (DO11-Start)
00150                 cmds=cpcmds                                                                                        
00151                 switch='change anycase ~userid()~'Userid()'~ | 'switch' | hole'                                    
00152                 End                                                                                  (DO11-End)
00153 If switch='CMS' Then Do                                                                              (DO12-Start)
00154                 cmds=cmscmds                                                                                       
00155                 switch='change anycase ~userid()~'Userid()'~ | 'switch' | cons'                                    
00156                 End                                                                                  (DO12-End)
00157 'PIPE (NAME STDPROF.EXEC:120 END ?)',                                                                              
00158     'var cmds',                                  /* Take this        */                                            
00159     '| split at ;',                              /* Split here       */                                            
00160     '| strip',                                   /* Remove spaces    */                                            
00161     '| 'switch                                   /* Run this         */                                            
00162                                                                                                                    
00163 Select                                                                                           {SEL3-Start}
00164 When a Then Do                                                                                       (DO13-Start)
00165             b                                                                                                      
00166             End                                                                                      (DO13-End)
00167 When c Then Do                                                                                       (DO14-Start)
00168             d                                                                                                      
00169             e                                                                                                      
00170             End                                                                                      (DO14-End)
00171 Otherwise f=1                                                                                                      
00172 End                                                                                              {SEL3-End}
00173 Return                                                                                         [SUB4-End]
00174                                                                                                                    
00175                                                                                                                    
00176 CheckFile:                                                                                     [SUB5-Start]
00177 /*---------------------------------------------------------------+                                                 
00178 | Check if the requested file exists                             |                                                 
00179 +---------------------------------------------------------------*/                                                 
00180 Parse Upper Arg filein                                                                                             
00181 'PIPE (NAME PROF.EXEC:120 END ?)',               /* .                */                                            
00182   'cms LISTFILE 'filein' * (NOH ISO',            /* Locate a file    */                                            
00183   '| pick 1.6 \== ~DMSLST~',                     /* Ignoree this     */                                            
00184   '| count lines',                               /* How many         */                                            
00185   '| var state'                                  /* Store as boolean */                                            
00186 If state>1 Then state=1                                                                                            
00187 Return state                                                                                   [SUB5-End]
00188                                                                                                                    
00189                                                                                                                    
00190 LoadFile:                                                                                      [SUB6-Start]
00191 /*---------------------------------------------------------------+                                                 
00192 | Read the requested file and load the values                    |                                                 
00193 +---------------------------------------------------------------*/                                                 
00194 Parse Upper Arg filein                                                                                             
00195 'PIPE (NAME STDPROF.EXEC:147 END ?)',                                                                              
00196     '< 'filein' *',                              /* Read this file   */                                            
00197     '| strip',                                   /* Remove spaces    */                                            
00198     '| pick 1.1 \== ~~ and',                     /* Ignore these     */                                            
00199            '1.1 \== ~*~',                        /* ...lines         */                                            
00200     '| join * x40',                              /* Make 1 record    */                                            
00201     '| split anycase before string ~:access_items.~', /* Split at         */                                       
00202     '| split anycase before string ~:tooling.~',      /* .these           */                                       
00203     '| split anycase before string ~:cpcmds.~',       /* .                */                                       
00204     '| split anycase before string ~:cmscmds.~',      /* .                */                                       
00205     '| split anycase before string ~:alt_tooling.~',  /* .                */                                       
00206     '| split anycase before string ~:ifrc0.~',        /* .                */                                       
00207     '| split anycase before string ~:run.~',          /* .                */                                       
00208     '| split anycase before string ~:pre_exit.~',     /* .                */                                       
00209     '| split anycase before string ~:post_exit.~',    /* .                */                                       
00210     '| split anycase before string ~:servercode.~',   /* .                */                                       
00211     '| split anycase before string ~:serverenv.~',    /* .                */                                       
00212     '| change ~:~/~ 1',                          /* Prep 4 varload   */                                            
00213     '| change ~.~/~ 1',                          /* .idem            */                                            
00214     '| xlate fs / f2 upper',                     /* ..idem           */                                            
00215     '| varload'                                  /* Hand 2 rexx      */                                            
00216 Return                                                                                         [SUB6-End]
00217                                                                                                                    
00218                                                                                                                    
00219 Init:                                                                                          [SUB7-Start]
00220 /*---------------------------------------------------------------+                                                 
00221 | Initialise all possible values                                 |                                                 
00222 +---------------------------------------------------------------*/                                                 
00223 pre_exit=''     ; post_exit=''                                                                                     
00224 access_items='' ; ifrc0=''                                                                                         
00225 tooling=''      ; alt_tooling=''                                                                                   
00226 cpcmds=''       ; cmscmds=''                                                                                       
00227 servercode=''   ; serverenv='CMS'                                                                                  
00228 run=''                                                                                                             
00229 Return                                                                                         [SUB7-End]
00230                                                                                                                    
00231                                                                                                                    
00232 TimeStamp:                                                                                     [SUB8-Start]
00233 Return Date('S') Time() myfn                                                                   [SUB8-End]
 
 
